ace":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line040:m0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"公孫淵","kind":"person","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line040:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line040:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":40,"last_line":40,"revision_id":2131313,"raw_start":4230,"raw_end":4258,"character_positions":[4230,4231,4232,4233,4234,4235,4236,4237,4238,4239,4240,4241,4242,4243,4244,4245,4246,4247,4248,4249,4250,4251,4252,4253,4254,4255,4256,4257]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-058","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-058-luxun"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041","text":"淵憑險恃固，拘留大使，名馬不獻，實可仇忿。蠻夷猾夏，未染王化，鳥竄荒裔，拒逆王師，至令陛下爰赫斯怒，欲勞萬乘泛輕越海，不慮其危而涉不測。方今天下雲擾，群雄虎爭，英豪踴躍，張聲大視。陛下以神武之姿，誕膺期運，破操烏林，敗備西陵，禽羽荊州，斯三虜者當世雄傑。皆摧其鋒。聖化所綏，萬里草偃，方蕩平華夏，總一大猷。今不忍小忿，而發雷霆之怒，違垂堂之戒，輕萬乘之重，此臣之所惑也。臣聞志行萬里者，不中道而輟足；圖四海者，匪懷細以害大。強寇在境，荒服未庭，陛下乘桴遠征，必致窺闟，戚至而憂，悔之無及。若使大事時捷，則淵不討自服；今乃遠惜遼東眾之與馬，奈何獨欲捐江東萬安之本業而不借乎？乞息六師，以威大虜，早定中夏，垂耀將來。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"淵","kind":"person","person_id":"z0r_ri5_noq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041:m0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"操","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line041:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"備","kind":"pe